  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 602.22 High salt marsh",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 602.22 “High salt marsh” means a tidal marsh zone located above mean high water and inundated during periods of extreme high tide and storm surge associated with coastal storms.\n\nSource. #12806, eff 12-15-19",
